window.products.push({"id":114029,"name":"RangeSafe Stove Safety Knob (Black As Seen in GH Magazine. Locking Gas Stove Knobs Will Help Reduce Risk of Accidental Ignition. Helps Protect Childre","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HeVVtRGgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"RangeSafe stove replacement Safety Knobs increase safety and help to provide peace of mind. Protect Your Family and Home with RangeSafe Safety Knobs   Traditional stove knobs only require a user to slightly push and twist to ignite the burner, which can often lead to accidental ignition or gas leaks.  Stove knobs can be accidentally turned on by bumping into them, curious toddlers playing with the knobs and mischievous pets looking for food on a range.   Until recently, the only protection that was available to address this concern was plastic knob covers.  Although somewhat effective, stove users find that plastic covers are both inconvenient to use and unattractive to look at, and eventually end up being removed and stored in the kitchen drawer.    RangeSafe has developed an innovative “pinch, push, and turn” safety stove knob replacements knob. The patented “pinch” feature acts as an automatic locking mechanism, reducing the chance of knobs being unintentionally turned on.  RangeSafe Safety Knobs are not only a more effective solution but are also more visually appealing than plastic covers. As a result, RangeSafe Safety Knobs maintain the pleasing aesthetics of ranges while addressing users' concerns and creating peace of mind.   Features  Stylish Looking Replacement Stove Safety Knob Unique Patented Automatic Locking Mechanism. Fits Most Manufacturers Stoves. Easy To Install. 2 Year Warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HeVVtRGgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RangeSafe Stove Safety Knob","source_asin":"B08CK7JD5V","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-114029","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CK7JD5V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CK7JD5V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
