window.products.push({"id":114065,"name":"Ultra Durable WR17X11653 Refrigerator Ice Dispenser Door Flap Replacement Part by BlueStars – Exact Fit For GE & Kenmore Refrigerators - Replaces AP36","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7132MWGSNiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Perfect replacement The dispenser door assembly (or flapper) is what opens to release the ice once the lever has been pressed. This part mounts in the ice dispenser. Occasionally it gets dysfunctional calling for an immediate replacement to continue enjoying the fresh cold water from your dispenser. Easy installation For this repair, all you will need is a screwdriver and a small flat blade. Disconnect the power, remove the escutcheon from around the dispenser, lift up the control panel, disconnect all wire connectors, use a screwdriver to remove all four screws of the housing, and lift the housing out. You will now see the flapper: push the tabs that are securing it in place to remove the piece, install the new flapper by lining it up and snapping into place. Compatibility Compatible with part numbers 1032671, AH964304, AP3672582, EA964304, PS964304, WR17X3093, WR17X3492. Compatible with GE brands which include Kenmore, Hotpoint, Sears, and so much more. Features Easy to use and install Easy to use and install Stable and flexible Stable and flexible Food grade material for you Food grade material for you Solve the following symptoms Door sweats inside or outside Door sweats inside or outside Ice maker won't dispense ice Ice maker won't dispense ice Enjoy Cold Drinks Always!! Click Add to Cart for This Easy to Install Refrigerator Ice Dispenser Door Flaps for A Healthy Cold Drink","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7132MWGSNiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BlueStars","source_asin":"B07YNLJB94","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-114065","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YNLJB94","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YNLJB94","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
