window.products.push({"id":114211,"name":"2023 Upgraded w10780048 suspension rods w10400895 washer suspension spring(4pcs) Replacement kit for Whirlpool Kenmore Roper washer suspension rod kit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7189ljdCRuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【UPGRADE W10780048 RODS KIT】:The w10780048 suspension rod kit supports the washer tub and keeps it stable during unbalanced loads, acts as a shock absorber that allows the washer tub to move while helping minimize vibration in the spin mode. If the washer goes out of balance and shakes with each load, this kit may fix the problem. The W10780048 whirlpool suspension MADE OF ABS PLASTIC MATERIAL & SILICA GEL CONSTRUCTION, durable long-lasting.Hook design and easy to install.►Length 60cm/23.6in.If one or more of the suspension rods are broken,the washer will vibrate or shake,you need use these washer rods. ✅【4 PACK W10400895 WASHER SUSPENSION SPRING】: The W10400895 Washer Suspension Tub Centering Spring is located around the drum of the washing machine and are distributed between the drum and the washing machine suspension rod. The springs reduce the amount of wobble fixed between the suspension ball and the drum, thus allowing the drum to be kept in balance. One spring should be used on each of the four sides of each washing machine to enable the springs to function better. The package includes 4 x W10400895 Suspension Spring. The upgraded version has been upgraded in material so that the spring is less prone to deformation and reverts well to its previous appearance after elongation. ✅【PACKAGE INCLUDES】①These W10780048 whirlpool wtw6600sw2 suspension rod kit replacement assembly includes 4 x W10780048 suspension rod kit & 4 x W10400895 washer suspension spring,contains all the required replacement parts to complete the standard installation of your washer. It can be quickly and easily installed by a service personnel or by yourself with proper tools and safety precautions.The unbalanced load error \"uL\" in Cabrio style machines is often caused by faulty suspension. ✅【SUITABLE FOR MOST DRYER MODELS】4 pcs W10780048 Suspension Rod Kit and 4 pcs W10400895 washer suspension spring replaces for Admiral,Amana,Crosley,Kenmore,Maytag and Roper washer suspension rod kit and repalces Part W10257087, W10257088, W10349191, W10349193, W10748952, W10821948, 4185114, ►W10780048 Suspension Rod Kit Suitable for Models mvwx655dw1, mvwb850yw1, wtw4616w0,  wtw5000dw, wtw8800yc1, wtw4800xq2, wtw4800xq4, ntw4560yq0, ap5971398, 110.20232710, 110.20022014, 110.20022013 etc. ✅【365 DAYS WARRANTY】The product W10780048 & W10400895 Whirlpool Suspension Kit(PACK OF 4)supports 1 YEAR return and exchange.Whirlpool W10780048 Suspension Rod Maintaining the balance of the washing tub of the washing machine to reduce vibration and shaking. When the washing machine has a large vibration imbalance or code error, the washing machine damper maintain a balance, so that the washing machine can maintain balance and resume normal use.Length 23 1/2 length ✅【EASY TO INSTALL】If your washing machine has the following situations during use,you may need to replace the 4 pack W10780048 Suspension Rod Kit:☞The washer load is unbalanced ☞The leveling legs need to be adjusted ☞The flooring is weak ☞Something in the washer is broken ☞The washer still has shipping bolts ☞The customer may have read the wrong size and chose the wrong suspension rod ☞Customers may have received defective products.►Our devices are simple to install and eliminate the need to seek out a skilled repairer. The following equipment is required for this installation: Philips screwdriver, putty knife, duct tape, a strap and gloves.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7189ljdCRuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaquicy","source_asin":"B08L5WTPGZ","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-114211","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08L5WTPGZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08L5WTPGZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
