window.products.push({"id":114287,"name":"Counter Top Dishwasher, Portable Dishwasher with 5 Programs, High Temperature, Air-Dry, Child Lock, Dishwasher Basket, Delay Function, Mini Dishwasher","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61iuKa8VvrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【COMPACT SIZE & LARGE CAPACITY】Hissun countertop dishwasher measures 17.32*16.25*16.69 inches, it can hold 4 full place settings and fit up to 12-inches dishes in diameter at an angle. Easily meeting the daily needs of a family of 3-4, and ideal for small-sized apartments, dorms, small kitchens, and cabins. 【5 WASHING PROGRAMS】All the features of a full-size washer in a smaller size, this portable dishwasher provides 5 washing programs: Normal, Rapid, ECO, Intensive, and Glass. One-touch control to choose the suitable program based on different materials and stains. The spray arms at the bottom provide dishes with 360° all-around rotating powerful and deep cleaning. 【160℉ HIGH-TEMPERATURE】The water temperature of this high-efficiency countertop dishwasher is up to 160°F, which can easily remove stuck-on and dried food particles. It also ensures thorough cleaning of baby bottles and oily tableware. After turning dirty dishes sparkling clean, it will use the residual temperature to dry automatically. 【CLEAN WATER SOURCE】 The automatic water supply method with a water hose connection can ensure a clean water source for washing tableware. This mini dishwasher equips with a faucet adapter set and needed hose, which you can direct water hookup to the kitchen faucet effortlessly. Make your tableware shine like new. 【EASY TO OPERATE】The operation is more convenient with its LED touch screen display angled to face you. Thanks to the see-through doors, you can observe the food stains get cleaned off your tableware in real-time. Features Child-Lock, Leak Protection, and Delay Timer, our countertop dishwasher is an easier and safer choice for you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61iuKa8VvrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HISSUN","source_asin":"B09ZTHR3MZ","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-114287","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ZTHR3MZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ZTHR3MZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":114288,"name":"Bertazzoni Professional Series QB36500X 36 Gas Cooktop, 5 Sealed Burners, 18,000 BTU Brass Burner","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716x3BIKx3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Bertazzoni Stainless Steel Sealed Burner Cooktop QB36500X. The 5 burners cooktop, with the power burner in the center, is low-profile and sits almost flush with the countertop. Bertazzoni's exclusive dual power burner in cast brass delivers high-efficiency performance from delicately low simmer to full power (750 - 18,000 BTUs) with best-in-class heat-up time. Brass Burners: 5. Dual Power Burner: 750 - 18,000 BTU/h. Rapid: 11,000 BTU/h. Semi-Rapid: 6,200 BTU/h. Auxiliary: 750 - 3,400 BTU/h. Electrical Requirements: 120V / 60Hz. Max. Amp Usage: 1 Amp. Certification: CSA. Warranty: 2 Years Parts and Labor. Simmer Ring: Included. Wok Ring: Included. Overall Width: 36 13/32. Overall Depth: 20 15/32. Overall Height: 3 11/16. Cutout Width: 35 5/8. Cutout Depth: 20 1/2. BERTAZZONI cooking products originate in Emilia-Romagna, a region world-famous for its food. Precision-engineered to the highest specifications by the Bertazzoni family, who have been making high-quality ranges since the beginning of the last century, every appliance bearing the Bertazzoni name represents an unwavering commitment to quality. Bertazzoni's new Brass Power Burners offer enhanced style and increased output of 18,000 BTU's. Bertazzoni Professional Series 36 5-Brass Burner Low-Profile Cooktop Bertazzoni drop-in gas cooktops bring professional performance and surface cooking convenience together in an elegant solution. Available in 5 burners configuration, Bertazzoni Pro gas cooktops have the same one-piece, seamless, high-efficiency worktop design that has become the signature of Bertazzoni freestanding ranges. All burners are in cast brass for enhanced performance, with the dual control brass power burner delivering best-in-class heat-up times and maximum flexibility thanks to its wide BTU range.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716x3BIKx3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bertazzoni","source_asin":"B004P5ZDIA","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-114288","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004P5ZDIA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B004P5ZDIA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
