window.products.push({"id":114374,"name":"131763310 Door Lock Strike Striker for Kenmore Electrolux Frigidaire Washer - Replaces: AP3580441 1032664 131763300 890617","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":5.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51XXgLTOGsL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"The door strike on your washing machine allows your washer door to lock properly, and operate efficiently. If you notice that your washer door will not open or close, leaks, or the washer will not start or spin, you may need to replace the door strike. The part is made of plastic and is roughly 2 inches in length. To complete this repair, you will only need a Phillips screwdriver. Replaces the following part numbers: 1032664, 131763300, 131763310, AP3580441 1032664, 131763300, 131763310, AP3580441 Works for brand: Frigidaire, Kenmore, Crosley, Gibson, Westinghouse, Electrolux. Fit models: Kenmore: 41724182300,41724182301, 41727182700,etc Frigidaire: ATFB6000ES0, BLTF2940ES0, BLTF2940ES1, etc Gibson: GTF1040AS0,GTF1040CS0, GTF1040CS1, etc Fixes problem with: Lid or door won’t close Will Not Start. Lid or door will not open Will not fill with water. Notice: The washer door must be latched shut in order for the washer to start. Contact Us If you are not sure if part is correct, ask us in Customer questions & answers section or contact us by visiting the Discount Parts Direct storefront. Business Wholesale We are a small local company from Houston, Texas offer discount parts for retail and wholesale. If you need to purchase parts for business , please contact us for lower rates.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51XXgLTOGsL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Discount Parts Direct","source_asin":"B07M93HN4F","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-114374","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07M93HN4F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07M93HN4F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
