window.products.push({"id":114381,"name":"Portable Washing Machine, 18 Watts Folding Ultrasonic Turbine Washer with 2.6 Gal Collapsible Bucket, USB Mini Washing Machine for Home Camping RV Bus","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71diAGQ3txL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💦【UPGRADED HIGH POWER TURBINE】- Added turbine overload protection scheme. The washing machine will automatically shut down when overloaded or the clothes are not balanced. This feature ensures a longer lifespan of turbine. The power of the mini turbine is 18 watts, which is higher than similar products on the market and provides better cleaning. 💦【POWERFUL PERFORMANCE MOTOR】- Equipped with a 570RPM powerful and durable copper wire motor, which has greater wave pulsates and new water flow compared with similar product, which not only produces less twisting of the clothing, but also provides better cleaning and washing effect. 💦【INNOVATIVE WORKING PRINCIPLE 】-Turbine mode turns forward and backward to simulate hand washing. The ultrasonic mode begins to vibrate at high frequency, effectively emulsifying the stain. You just need to plug in the semi-automatic washing machine. After 30 minutes, it will finish the washing process and stop automatically. 💦【PRACTICAL LIFE HELPER】 - Do you still wash all your clothes together? The ultrasonic turbo washing machine will be your own personal washer, it can save time that you don't have to go to laundry mat or wash by hand. Using this compact washer to wash clothes, fruits, vegetables, toys, reusable sanitary napkins and other items. 💦【COMPACT AND LIGHTWEIGHT】 - Only 2.2 inches thick when folded, easily fits in a backpack or suitcase. It weighs 5 pounds, is convenient for you to move and store in cabinets, RVs, dormitories. This is an ideal choice for small households with limited space and minimal optimal. (Please note: You need to dry your clothes by hand or with a machine. This is not a dryer)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71diAGQ3txL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YOUTHUP","source_asin":"B09KZYVTBX","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-114381","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09KZYVTBX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09KZYVTBX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":114382,"name":"30 Inch Gas Cooktop, Built-in Stainless Steel 5 Burners Gas Stovetop LPG/NG Convertible Gas Stove Dual Fuel Gas Hob with Thermocouple Protection DM527","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":219.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QD7l6-scL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our products use brushed stainless steel material ,It has the characters of anti-rust,difficult deformation and easy to clean.When cleaning, please use the soft cloth with light cleanser. Even there are scratches on the panel, just use steel wool scrub along the line direction on the panel. Product Features Direction 1,Our product size and cut hole size will be show in the insert pictures. There are four type of burners: 3.3kw triple Ring work burner,2.75kw Rapid Burner,1 or 2 1.75kw Semi Rapid burner,1 kw Auxiliary Burner; Which make all kinds of heating power output.The cast iron support are heavy and stable, coated with enamel , make it high temperature resistance and not easy to rust. the four feet under the cooker make it can use as table-top style also, easy to cook all kinds of food as you like. 2,This products is suitable for Nature Gas source but there are convert nozzle and BS brass joint for LPG source in the package.There is adjustment valve for flame adjustment. When you think the minimum flame is not enough,it can adjust in the place of knob and We rather professional to do so .If you want to change the gas source, please invite professional. Function attention 1,Our product take 110 V AC power ignition with safety device, but if without AC power, it can ignition with lighter or other flame. 2,The figure of product will confirm by main product picture. 3, Our product have 100% inspection on whole products, gas leakage inspection and valves inspection and enjoy our products safely. 4,After installation of our product, please check all the joints and make sure they are sealed well.Put the burner set, burner caps and woks are in the right position. 5,You can click the blue Deli-mate after the Sold by will find more products in our shop. 6,If you have any other requirement on products or service please leave your message in our Customer Questions& answers in the website.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QD7l6-scL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Deli-mate","source_asin":"B0BBVPQCC8","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-114382","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BBVPQCC8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BBVPQCC8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
