window.products.push({"id":114425,"name":"Vypart MP22YA Electric Range Burner Element Replacement Part -2 x MP21YA 8\" and 2 x MP15YA 6\" Replacement fit for Electric Range Stove 4 PACK","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.69,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+Gdh0Hu6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PRODUCT DETIAL: MP22YA Electric Range Burner set includes 2 pack MP21YA-8 inch,2 pack MP15YA-6 inch. It has a \"Y\" style bracket, as shown in picture. Electric stoves rely on electrical resistance to heat up the burners on the cooktop, which means they function much in the same way as electric heaters. A stove burner draws much more power than a heater, so they must be connected to a 240-volt circuit to get that power. PREMIUM QUALITY MATERIAL: Vypart manufacture all products with premium quality original material. MP21YA - 8\" 2100 watt 230 volts 5 turns, MP15YA - 6\" 1500 watt 230 volts 4 turns. The replacement part is made from durable high quality material and well-tested by the manufacturer to ensure the long lasting usage. REPLACEMENT PART#:The electric stove burners element replacement 5304431014, SU204, 484783, TS5W8221, 404099, Y04000033, S58Y21, SU205, 660532, TS4W6215,5303310283, 04080, 04000034, Y04000034, WB30T10089, 484782, 12001231, 9761347, S46Y15.If you are not sure whether it is fit your electric stove, please send us an email, our product engineer will help you check the models. NO WORRY TO BUY: Your satisfaction is our top priority. Thus, we provide a 1-YEAR warranty and a 90-DAYS return & exchange policy. If you have any questions when shopping MP22YA Electric Range Burner Element , feel free to contact us, and we will try our best to solve the problems. Installation Tips: Disconnect your machine from all its power source before starting the repair. Worked SYMPTOMS:If you have following problems, that means you might need to change a new MP22YA Electric Range Burner Element. The surface burner element is not heating up. 2. The end connection was corroded. 3. Element will not heat. Fortunately, replacing the electric range burner element is much cheaper than a whole stove. You can fix it by your self! Must cut off all the power!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+Gdh0Hu6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vypart","source_asin":"B08Y1N53ZB","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-114425","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Y1N53ZB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Y1N53ZB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
