window.products.push({"id":114441,"name":"OEM EBF49827801 Washer Door Lock Assembly by Beaquicy - Replacement for Kenmore and LG Washing Machine wm2501hwa,wm3470hva,wm2016cw,wm3470hwa,E301032,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.39,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61YUk8HOKsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【𝟑𝟔𝟓 𝑫𝑨𝒀𝑺 𝑾𝑨𝑹𝑹𝑨𝑵𝑻𝒀】--- The product EBF49827801 Washer Door Lock Assembly supports 365 days return and exchange. ➤The EBF49827801 Washer Door Lock Switch Assembly is an OEM product that is guaranteed in terms of quality. Made from high quality ABS plastic, the upgraded door lock has improved cracking and deformation and is less prone to wear and tear, giving the door lock a longer life. The lock locks better during opening and closing of the washing machine door, so that the door does not open during operation. 【𝑷𝑹𝑶𝑫𝑼𝑪𝑻 𝑺𝑷𝑬𝑪𝑰𝑭𝑰𝑪𝑨𝑻𝑰𝑶𝑵𝑺】--- This EBF49827801 Washer Door Lock Assembly prevents the washer lid from opening during the wash cycle and spin cycle.The manufacturer has replaced this item (part number EBF49827801) with part number 6601ER1004C.Lid lock EBF49827801 replacement part is made from durable high quality material and well-tested by the manufacturer - Ensure long-lasting and effective performance. ➤The EBF49827801 Washer Door Lock Switch solves the FOLLOWING SYMPTOMS: The washing machine will not start. The washer door will not close. Washer door will not open. 【𝑷𝑨𝑪𝑲𝑨𝑮𝑬 𝑰𝑵𝑪𝑳𝑼𝑫𝑬𝑺】--- Includes 1 x EBF49827801 washer door lock.It can solve these problems that washer cycles were very erratic, stopping or taking much longer than usual.Once in a while getting message \"door open\". L-G Tromm front load washer had multiple codes and intermittent operation with washer stopping mid load.Replacement parts after a number of process inspection, quality assurance. 【𝑺𝑼𝑰𝑻𝑨𝑩𝑳𝑬 𝑭𝑶𝑹 𝑲𝑬𝑵-𝑴𝑶𝑹𝑬 𝑨𝑵𝑫 𝑳-𝑮 𝑾𝑨𝑺𝑯𝑬𝑹】--- EBF49827801 Washer Door Lock Assembly compatible with Ken-more and L-G Washing Machine. ➤Replaces: 6601ER1004C, 6601ER1004E, EBF49827802. ➤Compatible: 79640318900, 79641473210, 79641532110, 79641538110, 79641542110, 79641548110, 79641549110, 79641722010, 79641728010, 79642192900, 79642198900, 79642199900, 79648842800, 79648852800, 79641532210, 79641728900, WM3470HVA, WM2010CW, WM2677HWM, WM2688HNM, WM2688HNMA, WM2688HWM, WM2688HWMA, WM3677HW, WM3987HW, WM3988HWA, wm2277hs, wm2650hwa, wm2650hra, wm3987wh, wm2016cw, wm2301hw, wm2250cw, wm2050cw, wm2688hnma, wm2501hwa, wm2655hva, wm3470hva, wm2101hw, etc. 【𝑬𝑨𝑺𝒀 𝑻𝑶 𝑰𝑵𝑺𝑻𝑨𝑳𝑳】---EBF49827801 Washer Door Lock Assembly was easy to install.Remove 2 screws at the back of the lid.Slide the lid towards the rear about 1 inch.Lift lid off.Unplug the connector from the lock assembly will want to do this with the assembly still screwed in.Unscrew the 2 screws,hold assembly from inside while undoing the last screw, don't want it to fall to the bottom.Remove old assembly, put new one in. Once plugged in, install in proper position and screw back in place.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61YUk8HOKsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaquicy","source_asin":"B08LV9BZ1B","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-114441","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08LV9BZ1B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08LV9BZ1B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":114442,"name":"Certified Appliance Accessories Ice Maker Water Line, 10 Feet, Polyester-Reinforced PVC, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81NVpCsvvkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"1/4 x 1/4 INCH CONNECTOR HOSE – 1/4 inch FCM (Female Compression) x 1/4 inch FCM stainless steel fittings with washers provide secure connection. BUILT TO LAST - Polyester-reinforced PVC connector has permanently attached stainless steel couplings & brass stems. DURABLE DESIGN - This durable design protects against bursting & cracking in your ice maker water supply line. CERTIFIED FOR YOUR SAFETY – This hose is UPC (Uniform Plumbing Code), NSF 61 & 372 lead-free (National Sanitation Foundation), & CSA (Canadian Standards Association) certified for product safety. 5-YEAR LIMITED WARRANTY – If your hose isn’t in perfect working condition for at least 5 years, we’ll send you a new one free of charge.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81NVpCsvvkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Certified Appliance Accessories","source_asin":"B00UH361YY","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-114442","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00UH361YY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B00UH361YY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
