window.products.push({"id":114470,"name":"EUHOMY Commercial Under Counter Ice Maker Machine, 80 Lbs/Day Auto-Cleaning Drain Pump & 24H Timer, Stainless Steel Built-in Freestanding Ice Maker, 2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":699.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LVAO1+JsL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Advanced & Fast Ice Making: Our commercial under counter ice maker machine can produce 80 lbs of ice in 24 hours, providing 40 clear ice cubes every 15-20 minutes for you and your family. The 24 lb storage container ensures a constant supply of ice, meeting all your daily ice needs for your home, restaurant, bar, or hotel. Efficient Built-In Drain Pump & Compact Design: Equipped with a drain pump for effective water draining without relying on gravity, capable of pumping water to a maximum height of 35.5\". The built-in design with dimensions of 14.96 x 18.47 x 33.99 inches (including adjustable feet) makes it perfect for any standard height kitchen or bar counter, while also allowing the ice maker to be used as a standalone unit. Reversible Door & Cold Insulation: The stainless steel ice maker machine door with a handle can be installed with left or right hinges, allowing you to choose the opening direction according to your needs. The 3-layer housing material ensures longer-lasting ice cubes, preventing them from melting quickly. Smart LCD Control Panel & Customizable Ice Thickness: The multifunctional control panel displays the ambient temperature and allows you to adjust the ice cube size by changing the ice-making time. The 24-hour timer function lets you set the machine to start or stop running at your convenience. Easy-to-Clean & Prolonged Life: The self-cleaning function, activated by pressing the \"Timer Clean\" button for 5 seconds, helps maintain the ice maker's efficiency and longevity. We recommend cleaning the machine regularly according to usage. The ice maker requires a water supply . Be sure to keep the machine upright for at least 24 hours before using it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LVAO1+JsL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"E EUHOMY","source_asin":"B0C7QFCSYP","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-114470","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C7QFCSYP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C7QFCSYP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
