window.products.push({"id":114482,"name":"(4 Pack) Rayhoor 131763302 Washer Door Striker Replacement Part for Frigidaire & Electrolux & Kenmore& Crosley - Replaces 131763340, 134456602, 134456","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VWYp2jTtL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The door striker latches the door to the washing machine body. When latched properly, it signals to your washer that the door is locked and it’s okay to start the cycle. If the striker breaks, your washing machine won’t work properly. Thankfully, replacing a broken or missing door striker with the Rayhoor 131763302 equivalent part is quick and affordable. You just need a head screwdriver to complete the repair. Replaces the following parts: 131763302, AP4508273, 131763340, 134456602, 134456640, 1564512, AH2378364, EA2378364, and PS2378364. Compatible brands and models include but are not limited to: Fit for Frigidaire: ATF6500FG0, ATF6500GG0, ATF6500GG1, ATF6500GS0, ATF6700FE0 PTF7012MW1, SATF7000FS0, SATF7000FS1, STF7000FS0 Fit for Crosley Fit for Kenmore Fixes washing machine the following symptoms: * Door won’t close * Door won’t open * Won’t start * Won’t fill up with water * Won’t spin Specifications: * Material: ABS plastic * Color: Gray  * Product Dimensions: 2.6\"L x 0.6\"W x 1.3\"H (6.6 x 3.2cm)  * Diameter of install hole: 0.16\" (0.4cm) * Quantity: 4 Pcs Warm note: This is not original product, the mention of any related model designation above is only for purposes of demonstrating compatibility.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VWYp2jTtL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rayhoor","source_asin":"B07TSXCWC4","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-114482","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TSXCWC4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TSXCWC4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
