window.products.push({"id":114484,"name":"DC97-14486A Dryer Heating Element Assembly by Beaquicy - Replacement for Ken-more Sam-sung Dryer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61KJ621X6zL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【𝙋𝙍𝙊𝘿𝙐𝘾𝙏 𝘿𝙀𝙎𝘾𝙍𝙄𝙋𝙏𝙄𝙊𝙉】: The UPGRADED DC97-14486A Dryer Heating Element is for dryers. The dryer heating element assembly consists of the heating element, housing piping, upper limit thermostat and thermal fuse. The heating element converts electrical energy into thermal energy, which is used to dry clothes by generating heat through the element. Package includes 1 x DC97-14486A Dryer Heating Element Assembly. 【𝙈𝘼𝙏𝙀𝙍𝙄𝘼𝙇𝙎】: DC97-14486A Dryer Heating Element is made of high quality metal and stainless steel material for excellent durability and firmness, through the manufacturer's strict inspection and testing to ensure long-term effective operation. If heating element is broken, the dryer will have the following conditions, and the dryer heating element need to be replaced in time: ★The dryer is too hot; ★Dryer doesn't shut off; ★Takes too long to dry. 【𝟯𝟲𝟱 𝘿𝘼𝙔𝙎 𝙒𝘼𝙍𝙍𝘼𝙉𝙏𝙔】: DC97-14486A Dryer Heating Element Assembly supports 365 days return and exchange. Our company attaches great importance to the shopping experience of each customer. Risk-free shopping, if you have any quality problem during warranty period, please contact customer service in time. We will try our best to solve the problem. Customer satisfaction is our tireless pursuit. 【𝙒𝙄𝘿𝙀 𝘾𝙊𝙈𝙋𝘼𝙏𝙄𝘽𝙄𝙇𝙀】: This DC97-14486A assembly can replacement for Sam-sung dryers. ★DC97-14486A Replaces Numbers: DV316LEWXAA0000, DV419AEUXAA0000, DV419AEUXAA0001, DV419AEWXAA0000, DV419AEWXAA0002, DV219AEWXAA0000, DV219AEWXAA0001, DV220AEWXAA, DV2C6BEWXAA0000, DV410AERXAA, DV209AEWXAA0000, DV209AEWXAA0001, DV231AEWXAA0001, DV330AEW/XAA, DV410AEW/XAA, DV520AEW/XAA, DV328AEG/XAA, DV210AEW/XAA, DV410AER/XAA, DV220AEW/XAA, DV316BEW/XAA, DV5471AEP/XAA-01, DV419AEU/XAA-00, DV419AEU/XAA-01, etc. 【𝘽𝙍𝙄𝙉𝙂 𝘾𝙊𝙉𝙑𝙀𝙉𝙄𝙀𝙉𝘾𝙀 𝙁𝙊𝙍 𝙔𝙊𝙐𝙍 𝙇𝙄𝙁𝙀】: The installation of heating element DC97-14486A is simple. Before replacing, be sure to disconnect the power supply and wear work gloves to keep your hands safe. Install according to the installation video on YouTube. When your old heating element broken, simply replace the old element in your dryer with a new one. A simple installation in a few minutes can save you a lot of money on replacing the dryer or hiring a mechanic.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61KJ621X6zL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaquicy","source_asin":"B0888CW327","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-114484","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0888CW327","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0888CW327","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
