window.products.push({"id":114502,"name":"WP8181846 8181846 Whirlpool Washer Door Handle Duet Washing Machine Replacement Model GHW9150PW4 GHW9100LW2 GHW9100LW1 GHW9150PW1 GHW9200LW GHW9300PW4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":5.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41aTt+9-y6S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💡 Whirlpool 8181846 Handle - A high-quality exact equivalent for part numbers AP6011739, WP8181846, PS11744938, WP8181846VP. Washing Machine Door Handle is compatible with Whirlpool appliances. Whirlpool Duet Washer Handle 8181846 is designed to fit securely onto the door of the washing machine, providing a convenient way to open and close the door during loading and unloading of laundry. Door handles fit hundreds of models and can be installed in a few minutes. Screws are not included. 🔧 DIY eTips Included - Not sure how to replace the part? Helpful information can be found on the page below. Scroll down to get more repair tips. Acquire valuable skills during the DIY repair project. 8181846 Whirlpool Washer Door Handle Replacement will help if your appliance lid / door doesn't open or close, it shakes / moves, or there's a door latch failure. Installing the Whirlpool Washer Handle 8181846 is a relatively straightforward process that can be completed by most homeowners. 💡 Whirlpool Part Wp8181846 is made of high-quality materials that are designed to withstand the wear and tear of regular use. It is constructed from durable plastic and features a simple yet functional design that is easy to install and use. Whirlpool Door Handle Wp8181846 is also designed to be ergonomic, providing a comfortable and secure grip for users. Our Wp8181846 Door Handle meets or exceeds all manufacturer specifications. We provide a lifetime warranty and guarantee 100% money back. 💡 Can you replace the handle on a washing machine door? Yes, it is possible to replace the handle on a washing machine door. Replacing a washing machine door handle is a straightforward repair that can be done with basic tools and some DIY knowledge. The specific process for replacing a washing machine door handle can vary depending on the make and model of the machine. However, in general, the process involves removing the existing handle and installing the new one in its place. 💡 What are the most common problems with washer door handles? Some common problems include the handle becoming loose or difficult to open, the handle breaking, or the door not unlocking. To fix a loose or difficult-to-open door handle, you can try tightening the screws or clips that hold it in place. If the handle is broken, you'll need to replace it with a high-quality replacement part. If the door won't unlock, it could be due to a malfunctioning door lock or control board.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41aTt+9-y6S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PartsBroz","source_asin":"B07VK4LDHC","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-114502","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VK4LDHC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VK4LDHC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
