window.products.push({"id":114748,"name":"Oishii Pour Over Coffee Dripper and Reusable Brewer - Stainless Steel Filter with Unique Spiral Base","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Xhgf4IzEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Oishii Pour-Over Coffee Stainless Steel Micro Dripper and Brewer MAKE YOUR KITCHEN AN “OISHII” KITCHEN! Meaning “delicious” in Japanese, Oishii Pour-Over Coffee Micro Dripper is specially designed to help you make a delicious cup of coffee, each and every time! Modern Design with Quality Material Oishii pour over coffee filter cone has been quality engineered to help you brew the perfect cup of coffee. Featuring a contemporary spiral base design and laser cut 18/8 stainless steel mesh filter in a beautiful weave design, the filter maximizes the amount of taste in each cup while keeping the grounds out of your coffee Your Perfect Cup of Coffee Oishii Pour over filters do not absorb any essential oils or taste like a traditional paper filter does, and results in a flavorful, delicious cup of coffee. Start by placing your stainless steel coffee dripper on top of your favorite mug or thermos. Add 1-2 tablespoons of freshly ground coffee into the filter, then slowly pour 1 ounce of boiling water over the fresh grounds. Wait a few seconds for grounds to expand. Then add the rest of your water, pouring around the edges in a circular motion brewing to your strength preference. Each 1-2 tablespoons will make 6 ounces of fresh coffee. Feel free to play with the flexible spiral base to squeeze those last drops of delicious coffee into your cup! Premium Quality That We Guarantee At Oishii, your satisfaction is our guarantee. If you're not 100% SATISFIED simply return it for a full refund. Click the BUY NOW Button at the top of this page to buy your own set of Oishii Pour-Over Coffee Micro Dripper today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Xhgf4IzEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Oishii","source_asin":"B01BB71KEK","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-114748","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01BB71KEK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B01BB71KEK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":114749,"name":"HANSGO Egg Holder, 2-Layer Deviled Egg Tray with Lid and Handle Egg Carrier Box Dispenser Container with Handle for 48 Eggs","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61EEJGhi4vL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"What You Will Get - 1PC Two-layer Egg Holder (48-cup, each layer for 24 eggs, 12 x 8.5 x 4.2 inches, wrapped with a protective film layer) Sturdy & Durable Design - Our egg dispenser is made of food-grade plastic, firm and sturdy, arc edges, harmless to hands. The snap lockers bind upper and lower layers firmly. The handles are well fixed on the top, portable and high-strength. All eggs are well settled in the box without moving or clashing. Deviled Eggs Container - Our egg container comes with 48 cavities. So you can make 48 halves of deviled eggs for a large serving. If these deviled eggs can not be eaten up, you can keep the left in the fridge with our lock-up egg box, maintaining fresh and non-tainted. Large Capacity - Two separable layers, each layer for 24 eggs, holding up to 48 eggs with a weight of more than 6.6 pounds. The snap lockers on two sides can bind the layers firmly and tightly. If you don't need this many eggs, you can use the upper layer as a 24-cavity egg box. Widely Used - This dust-proof egg container is perfect for regular size eggs and deviled eggs. Suitable for kitchen pantry, fridge, freezer, food storage larder, etc. These plastic boxes can also contain strawberries, dumplings, hors d'oeuvres, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61EEJGhi4vL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HANSGO","source_asin":"B0C65H41X9","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-114749","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C65H41X9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C65H41X9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
