window.products.push({"id":114758,"name":"Maxblue XWF NSF Certified Refrigerator Water Filter, Replacement for GE® XWF, 3 Filters (Package may vary)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JmW08dVpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Replacement for models: GE XWF, GE WR17X30702, Maxblue MB-F48, AQUA CREST AQF-FF48, Filterlogic FL-RF48, Waterspecialist WS648A, CF9, GF-XWF, PF9. Note: XWF! This filter is replacement for XWF, not XWFE! Maxblue refrigerator water filter not only features prior filtration performance but also certified by authority NSF 42 and 372 for lead-free materials. Brilliant filtration: The filter can reduce a wide range of harmful substances in water including heavy metals, chlorine, odor, THM, VOCs, particles, cadmium, and all other major impurities, which has been tested by an independent third-party laboratory. Perfect fit: Our professional research team make effort to produce perfect fit refrigerator filters with exquisite engineering design without water leakage issues. Premium filter material: Maxblue adopts 100% selected coconut shell carbon block that contains larger surface area and more micropores than inferior carbon block. The adopted filter material in this replacement refrigerator filter adsorbs better. So, you get clean, fresh, and great-tasting water at all times. Month install stickers: Simply stick it onto your replacement water filters to know when it’s time to change it. Keep you drinking fresh with a little add-on. The filter life is 6 months or 200 gallons, which will vary based on the water condition. Hassle-free installation: The way we spend our time defines who we are. Maxblue strives to save your precious time by offering tool-free refrigerator filter replacement. Be responsible for each product: Each product or even a small component manufactured by Maxblue has to pass extremely high-standard examinations to reach the top requirement on the market. It’s not an ending if the filter leaves our factory. We will take responsibility for each of them. Compatible with: GBE21, GDE21, GDE25, GFE24, GFE26, GNE21, GNE25, GNE27, GYE18, QNE27, GSE25, GSS23, GSS25, GZS22, PSE25, CZS22, GNE27JSMSS, GNE27JMMES, GNE27ESMSS, GNE27JGMBB, GNE27JGMWW, GSE23, GSE23G, GSE26, CFE26, XFE26, CWE19. GE is a registered trademark of General Electric Company. GE is used for reference purposes only.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JmW08dVpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Maxblue","source_asin":"B07S5JY6L5","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-114758","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07S5JY6L5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07S5JY6L5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
