window.products.push({"id":114792,"name":"TrueGem Stove Gap Covers - 316 Stainless Steel, 25.4\" | Oven Side Gap Filler | Range Trim Kit | Guard Between Stove Top & Counter","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":56.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lxarMnUHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Made of 316 \"marine\" Stainless Steel. Will not corrode from salt like 304 stainless steel or aluminum covers. Will not melt like silicone covers. NO SHARP EDGES: Beautiful, consistently rounded top edge is a result of die cutting (not laser cut). Bottom outer edge is carefully rounded by hand and inspected twice to ensure no burrs or sharp feeling. BEAUTIFUL ADDITION TO KITCHEN: Brushed finish matches kitchen stove and other kitchen appliances. Looks like it is supposed to be there. Does not look like a floppy guard for a clumsy chef. EASY TO INSTALL: Just push it into oven side gap. No sticky tape or hardware required to install. EASY TO MAINTAIN: Integrated springs prevent it from sliding when wiping off the countertop & stovetop. Easy to remove for cleaning because spring tips are rounded (will not scrape or bind during removal). ARRIVES CLEAN & FREE OF SCRATCHES ON TOP SURFACE: The protective film used during manufacturing is removed. Each part is wiped down to remove any traces of film adhesive. Each part has top surface carefully inspected for scratches or dents. The top surfaces are wrapped in foam sheet and heavy cardboard to protect them during shipment. FITS NEXT TO GAS OR ELECTRIC STOVES, INCLUDING: Wolf, Samsung, GE, Kitchenaid, Frigidaire, Whirlpool, & Cafe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lxarMnUHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TrueGem","source_asin":"B0C3WMC4K2","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-114792","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C3WMC4K2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C3WMC4K2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
