window.products.push({"id":114806,"name":"Seeutek 2 in 1 Ice Maker Machine Countertop and Ice Shaver Machine Crushed Ice Maker 18 Cubes/11Mins 44lbs/Day Automatic and Manual Water Filling for ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":239.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LbyztyEXL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍸【2 in 1 Ice Maker】The multifunctional countertop ice maker machine can make ice and shaved ice, which can easily meet your needs. The simple control panel is easy to understand and operate, one-key start. Two methods to add water (manual and automatic), you can pour the water directly into the container, or connect to the faucet through the tube (water filter included). You can watch the ice making process through the transparent cover on the top. 🍹【Quickly Ice Making and Shaved Ice】The nugget ice makers can make 18 bullet shaped ice cubes in 11 minutes and 44 lbs in 24 hours. Ice Storage: 6.6 lbs. The ice cube maker is equipped with a powerful compressor cooling system and a silent DC fan, which has good cooling effect and low noise. The shaved ice function can quickly smash ice cubes into delicate smoothies within 30 seconds, you can immediately enjoy chilled drinks, such as whiskey, beer, juice and more. 🔔【Water Shortage Alarm/Ice Full Alarm】The crushed ice maker machine is designed with intelligent control system to automatically make ice. You can know the working status of the ice maker through the control panel. The pebble ice maker machine adopts advanced infrared sensing technology. When the sonic ice maker is short of water or full of ice, the machine will automatically stop working. After adding water or taking ice, the machine will automatically make ice. ✅【Self-Cleaning Function】The frigidaire ice maker is designed with self-cleaning function, you just need to add water to the sink and press and hold the on/off button for 5 seconds, the machine starts to clean automatically. The cleaning time is about 30 minutes, then stop working, remove the bottom rubber stopper to drain dirty water out of the machine. It would be better to add an appropriate amount of special detergent to the cleaning process. 🍺【Widely Used】The clear ice maker is made of 304 stainless steel with food grade cyclopentane foam layer inside to keep the temperature low and the ice cubes do not melt. Suitable for home, restaurants, offices, bars, parties and more, especially when the weather is hot and lots of ice is needed. Note: Before first use, keep it upright for more than 4 hours. One year warranty, free replacement. If you have any questions, please contact our customer service in time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LbyztyEXL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Seeutek","source_asin":"B0B5K6S13Q","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-114806","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5K6S13Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5K6S13Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
