window.products.push({"id":114932,"name":"DC97-15459G Washer Water Inlet Valve(OEM) by Beaquicy - 5 Years Warranty - Replacement for Samsung Washer - Replaces 3276197 AP5623056 PS4220861 EAP42","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yZjp6RJEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"plastic 【𝟏 𝑷𝑨𝑪𝑲 𝑶𝑬𝑴 𝑫𝑪𝟗𝟕-𝟏𝟓𝟒𝟓𝟗𝑮 𝑾𝑨𝑺𝑯𝑬𝑹 𝑾𝑨𝑻𝑬𝑹 𝑰𝑵𝑳𝑬𝑻 𝑽𝑨𝑳𝑽𝑬】: The DC97-15459G OEM Water Inlet Valve Assembly is for washer. The water valve is rated for 110/120 V, 60 Hz. The water inlet valve is used to control the flow of water into the washing machine. Each inlet valve has 5 solenoid valves and 2 threaded ports of 0.91\" diameter, connected to the hot and cold water pipes at the back of the washing machine. ➤Replacing the valve solves the FOLLOWING SYMPTOMS: Cannot stop water intake. The Washer does not feed water. Leakage at water valve. The washing machine displays the error codes F8, E1, LF, LO and FL. 【𝑺𝑼𝑰𝑻𝑨𝑩𝑳𝑬 𝑭𝑶𝑹 𝑴𝑨𝑵𝒀 𝑴𝑶𝑫𝑬𝑳𝑺】: DC97-15459G OEM Water Valve fits for Samsung washer. Replaces:3276197, AP5623056, PS4220861, EAP4220861. ➤Compatible with: WA50F9A6DSW/A2, WA50F9A7DSP/A2-00, WA50F9A7DSP/A2-01, WA50F9A7DSW/A2-00, WA50F9A7DSW/A2-01, WA50F9A8DSP/A2-01, WA50F9A8DSW/A2-01, WA50K8600AV/A2-00, WA50K8600AV/A2-11, WA50K8600AV/AA-00, WA50K8600AW/A2-00, WA52J8060AW/A2-00, WA52J8060AW/A2-01, WA52J8700AW/A2-00, WA54M8750AV/A4-00, WA54M8750AV/A4-01, WA48J7700AW/AA, WA48J7700AW/A2-11, WA50M7450AW/A4-01, WA48H7400AW/AA, WA48H7400AW/A2-11, WA48J7770AW/AA, WA48J7770AW/A2-01, WA48J7770AW/A2-02, WA48J7770AW/A2-11, WA52J8700AP/A2-01, WA52J8700AP/A2-02, WA52J8700AP/A2-11, etc. 【𝟓 𝒀𝑬𝑨𝑹𝑺 𝑮𝑼𝑨𝑹𝑨𝑵𝑻𝑬𝑬】: DC97-15459G Washer Water Valve Replacement supports 5 YEARS return and exchange. ➤Each water inlet valve has five solenoid valves and two threaded inlets. The water inlets are connected to the hot and cold water lines at the back of the washer. Each port is controlled by a solenoid valve that sends electrical power to turn the flow of hot and cold water on and off based on the wash temperature setting and the signal from the water level switch. 【𝑨𝑩𝑺 𝑷𝑳𝑨𝑺𝑻𝑰𝑪 𝑨𝑵𝑫 𝑺𝑻𝑨𝑰𝑵𝑳𝑬𝑺𝑺 𝑺𝑻𝑬𝑬𝑳 𝑴𝑬𝑻𝑨𝑳 𝑴𝑨𝑻𝑬𝑹𝑰𝑨𝑳𝑺】: The DC97-15459G Washing Machine Water Inlet Valve is made of high quality ABS plastic and stainless steel metal. It has undergone rigorous testing by the manufacturer and is a new GENUINE Samsung replacement part. The high standard of production makes the water valve will not seep, not easy to rust, and prolong the service life. The package includes 1 x DC97-15459G OEM Washer Water Inlet Valve. 【𝑪𝑶𝑽𝑬𝑵𝑰𝑬𝑵𝑻 𝑰𝑵𝑺𝑻𝑨𝑳𝑳𝑨𝑻𝑰𝑶𝑵】: Installing the DC97-15459G OEM Washer Water Valve is simple. Before installation, turn off the power and water supply and wear work gloves to protect your hands. Open the back cover of the washer, find the water valve, remove the fixed screw, disconnect the water pipe and wire. Replace the water valve with a new one and install it as it was before. Note: Do not mess up the connection position of water pipes and wires during installation to prevent installation failure.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yZjp6RJEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaquicy","source_asin":"B083JV2G1W","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-114932","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083JV2G1W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B083JV2G1W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
