window.products.push({"id":114972,"name":"Upgrade 279838 4531017 Dryer Heating Element Kit 3977767 3392519 Thermostat Fuse 3387134 3977393 Heating Element by Beaquicy - Fits for Whirl-pool Ken","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.67,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WgHPfXc6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【𝟐𝟕𝟗𝟖𝟑𝟖 𝑫𝑹𝒀𝑬𝑹 𝑯𝑬𝑨𝑻𝑰𝑵𝑮 𝑬𝑳𝑬𝑴𝑬𝑵𝑻 𝑲𝑰𝑻】: The 279838 Dryer Heating Element Assembly Kit includes 1 x 279838 Heating Element, 1 x 3977767 High Limit Thermostat, 1 x 3387134 Cycle Thermostat, 1 x 3392519 Thermal Fuse,1 x 3977393 Thermal Fuse. ➤Heating element is used to heat the air inside the dryer to dry it. A thermostat regulates the temperature to a safe heating range. A thermal fuse cuts off the current to avoid safety hazards caused by overheating. ➤If kit broken, the dryer will have the FOLLOWING CONDITIONS, and the heating element kit need to be replaced in time: Dryer takes too long to dry. Not enough heat. Dryer does not automatically shut off when it overheats. 【𝟓-𝑷𝑰𝑬𝑪𝑬 𝑯𝑬𝑨𝑻𝑰𝑵𝑮 𝑬𝑳𝑬𝑴𝑬𝑵𝑻 𝑺𝑬𝑻】: ➤The 279838 dryer heating element is rated at 5400 Watts 240 Volts and has 2- 5/16 male terminals. ➤The 3977767 Dryer High Limit Thermostat has one 1/4\" male terminal, 1/4\" female terminal, and one 3/16\" male terminal. ➤The 3387134 Cycling Thermostat has an internal offset heater that opens at 155℉ and closes at 130℉. ➤The 3392519 Thermal Fuse is non-recoverable thermal fuse with two 3/16\" wire terminals. It is used to cut off the power to the dryer or to stop the heating if the dryer overheats. ➤The 3977393 Thermal Fuse disconnects when the dryer temperature reaches 309℉, stopping the dryer from heating. 【𝟐 𝒀𝑬𝑨𝑹𝑺 𝑾𝑨𝑹𝑹𝑨𝑵𝑻𝒀】: 279838 Dryer Heating Element Kit supports 2 YEARS return and exchange. ➤The heating element 279838 has a heating wire made of high quality nickel. The 25% increase in length allows for faster and more uniform heating. ➤The kit is made of high quality stainless steel metal and ABS plastic materials for excellent durability and firmness. The upgraded heating kit has been upgraded in terms of material, being the product more heat resistant and the plastic part will not melt and fail due to the high temperature inside the dryer. The metal parts will not rust and break due to moisture in the dryer, which could cause the conductive heating properties to fail. 【𝑺𝑼𝑰𝑻𝑨𝑩𝑳𝑬 𝑭𝑶𝑹 𝑴𝑨𝑵𝒀 𝑩𝑹𝑨𝑵𝑫𝑺】: The 279838 Dryer Heating Element Kit can replacement for Whirl-pool, Ken-more, May-tag, Cros-ley and other brands dryer. ➤Kit compatible: ler5600jt0, lec5000pq1, ler3624pq0, lev4634jq1, ler4634eq2, ler7646eq1, ler7646eq2, leq8000jq0, ler8620pg0, 1106072010, 1106072011, 11060722990, 11060724990, 11060727990, 11066512692, 11061402310, 11060022010, 11062102310, rex3614kw1, rex3614kw2, rex3614pw0, rex3614pw2, rex3615ew0, med5600tq1, med5620tq0, med5620tq1, med5621tq0, med5630tq0, keys700jt0, keys700jt1, keys700lq0, keys700lq1, cedS774jq0, cedS774jq1, cedS774mq0, cedS774mq1, wed4815ew1, wed4815ew1, wed5000dw2, wed7300dw0, ned4600yq0, etc. 【𝑹𝑬𝑷𝑳𝑨𝑪𝑬𝑴𝑬𝑵𝑻 𝑴𝑶𝑫𝑬𝑳】: ➤279838 Heating Element Assembly replace: 2438, 279837, 279838, 279838A, 279838VP, 3398064, 3403585, 8565582, AP3094254, W10724237, W1072423, PS3343130, AH334313, EA334313, etc. ➤3977767 High Limit Thermostat replace: 3399693, 3977767, WP3977767VP, 898078, AP3131941, PS351925, EAP351925, etc. ➤3392519 Thermal Fuse replace: 3388651, G4AP0500, 3392519, 694511, 80005, WP3392519VP, WP3392519, 21900, 214500, 39800, etc. ➤3387134 Cycling Thermostat replace: 306910, 3387134, 3387135, 3387139, WP3387134VP, AP6008270, PS11741405, etc. ➤3977393 Thermal Fuse replace: 279816VP, 3399848, 3977393, AP3094244, PS334299, etc. 【𝑩𝑹𝑰𝑵𝑮 𝑪𝑶𝑵𝑽𝑬𝑵𝑰𝑬𝑵𝑪𝑬 𝑭𝑶𝑹 𝒀𝑶𝑼𝑹 𝑳𝑰𝑭𝑬】: The installation of 279838 Dryer Heating Element Kit is simple. Before replacing, turn off the power and water supply and wear work gloves. Remove the back cover of the dryer and locate where the heating element is located. Remove the fixing screws with a screwdriver, gently remove the heating element and disconnect the connected wires from the small temperature control unit and replace it. You can save a lot of money on replacing the dryer or hiring a mechanic. NOTE: When installing, please ensure that the kit is firmly connected to prevent the dryer from not running due to loose installation.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WgHPfXc6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaquicy","source_asin":"B083XSYMQ6","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-114972","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083XSYMQ6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B083XSYMQ6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
